    "body": "I'll be the first to admit I really don't understand how CSS \"levels\" work or why they exist. But I will note that these links all have `css-fonts-5` in them instead of `css-fonts`, so any reference to `<ref>CSSFONTS</ref>` will not go to Level 5 specification, but will instead appear to go to Level 4. What does this mean in practice?",
